OL,3,GNEWSAOur goal is to stop all migrant
OL,4,Aboats, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burham has said his
OL,7,Fgovernment will be "relentless" in
OL,8,Fworking towards stopping small boat
OL,9,Fcrossings completely, but he would not
OL,10,Fset a date on when that could be
OL,11,Fachieved.
OL,13,FIn an interview with BBC South East,
OL,14,Fjust days after two migrant vessels
OL,15,Freached the Kent coast unintercepted,
OL,16,Fhe backed Home Secretary Shabana
OL,17,FMahmood's call for a review into the
OL,18,Flandings, saying he wanted "urgent
OL,19,Fanswers".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
