OL,3,GNEWSAOur goal is to stop all migrant
OL,4,Aboats, says Burnham
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham said there would be "no
OL,7,Fcomplacency" in the crackdown on the
OL,8,Fpeople smuggling gangs behind the
OL,9,Foperation.
OL,11,F"We will not stop until we bear down on
OL,12,Fevery element of this criminal activity
OL,13,Fin a way that gets the numbers right
OL,14,Fdown," he said.
